  "description": "WebMarkupMin.AspNet.Brotli contains one compressor-adapter for compression of text content by using the Brotli algorithm - `LegacyBrotliCompressor`.\n`LegacyBrotliCompressor` is based on the BrotliSharpLib library and is intended for old versions of ASP.NET.",
