  "releaseNotes": "1. No longer supports a .NET Core 3.0 or higher;\n2. Three classes have been deprecated: `BrotliCompressor` class replaced by the `LegacyBrotliCompressor` class, `BrotliCompressionSettings` class replaced by the `LegacyBrotliCompressionSettings` class and `BrotliCompressorFactory` class replaced by the `LegacyBrotliCompressorFactory` class.",
